<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Homenaje a Violeta Parra (Mercedes Sosa)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1971</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover that made it known in the Spanish-speaking world</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Gracias a la vida (Joan Baez)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1974</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover; title track of her album</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Remedios (Gabriella Ferri)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1974</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Gracias a la Vida (Voces Unidas por Chile)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2010</span><span class="sg-chain-h">charity cover after the earthquake</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The 33 (film, Cote de Pablo)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2015</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover on the soundtrack</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Star-Crossed (Kacey Musgraves)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2021</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover</span></li></ul></section>
